  "contentHtml": "<p>저희</p><p>&#39;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&#39;가</p><p>&#160;</p><p>제1회 글로벌과학교육포럼에 초대되어</p><p>세션 B &#39;재미있는 과학수업 나눔&#39;을</p><p>&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; 운영하게 되었습니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/927bbfb715c4990f1de2d4d22fba00cb7550b3ce\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/927bbfb715c4990f1de2d4d22fba00cb7550b3ce\" data-origin-width=\"623\" data-origin-height=\"339\"></div><p>과학교사들을 위한 글로벌 행사이니</p><p>1만 2천 재과만 선생님들께서</p><p>함께 참여해주시면 감사하겠습니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>모두 온라인으로 진행하니</p><p>부담없이 참여하시면 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>- 일시 : 12.4.(토) 10:00~17:00</p><p>-장소 : 줌에서 온라인 접속</p><p>&#160;</p><p>- 참가 신청 :</p><p><a href=\"http://2021online.kofses.or.kr/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">http://2021online.kofses.or.kr/</a></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#39;사전등록&#39; 클릭하시면 됩니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>세션B 뿐만 아니라</p><p>세션A~세션H까지 다양한 주제가 있으니</p><p>자세히 살펴보시고 사전등록하시면 됩니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/418204551fbfea30d3b3947163f032b8ae76cbc5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/418204551fbfea30d3b3947163f032b8ae76cbc5\" data-origin-width=\"1258\" data-origin-height=\"289\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74b28da0eee8c1404e183eb49196cad914c78fe2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"461\" height=\"395\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74b28da0eee8c1404e183eb49196cad914c78fe2\" data-origin-width=\"895\" data-origin-height=\"767\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/64d90d3824d02d28826a9f37616ecb1ed7916009\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/64d90d3824d02d28826a9f37616ecb1ed7916009\" data-origin-width=\"795\" data-origin-height=\"1120\"></div><p>12.4(토) 포럼에서 뵙겠습니다!</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
